fix(s3): allow tagging without value (#1117)

The S3 tagging support empty value.
This commit allow this kind of tagging operation:
```
$ aws s3api put-object         --key empty-object --bucket my-bucket --tagging tag-without-value
$ aws s3api get-object-tagging --key empty-object --bucket my-bucket
{
    "TagSet": [
        {
            "Key": "tag-without-value",
            "Value": ""
        }
    ]
}
```
